    year = "1997",
    volume = "26",
    pages = "25--46",
    note = "Examines the continuing relevance of Marx to anthropological theory through three texts: The German Ideology (historical materialism), Capital vol. 1 (analysis of capitalism) and The Eighteenth Brumaire (political analysis). MARX-CENTRALITY: Title and main topic: Marx's work and anthropology.",
